                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Download an EPW weather file from climate.onebuilding.org nearest to your project location. Use the Search input to filter by station name, WMO ID, or dataset year.

Version 1.15.0.827

Version 1.15.0.827

Version 1.17.0.827

Version 1.19.0.827</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">14c83c45-923e-4ec6-b810-cd4b2c417d23</item>
