                    <chunk name="param_input" index="4">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Who traces the occlusion rays of the sweep (and of the raycast shortwave in MRT Solve). Auto: Embree when its natives load, else the OpenCL GPU when a device answers, else the managed BVH. GPU: the OpenCL GPU even where Embree loads, which pays off on the sweep's large ray batches; a fallback to Auto is reported in the log and as a warning, never silent.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">003c0ae5-5175-4793-a3bf-f4ff117143be</item>
