                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Annual mean radiant temperature at ground and building sensors, on the fast path.
Fidelity: Screening - surfaces at air temperature; no Radiance or EnergyPlus.
Method: MRT Surface tags ground and 22 context Breps; MRT Sensors on 2 m grids; MRT View Factors and MRT Solve with Atlanta weather.
Result: A coloured MRT mesh, Text Tag values, and one sensor's sky dome in Fisheye View.
Needs: Nothing to install; runs inside Rhino. Runtime: minutes.
Edit: Ground and context Breps, weather station; press the two Buttons to run.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
